_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I am trying to use multiple drones so i am assigning telementry1,2,3 for different drones to get positions of different drones.\r\n\r\n****\r\n     auto telemetry1 = Telemetry{system[0]};telemetry1::Position position1;\r\n    auto action1 = Action{system[0]};\r\n    auto offboard1 = Offboard{system[0]};\r\n    auto telemetry2 = Telemetry{system[1]};telemetry2::Position position2;\r\n    auto action2 = Action{system[1]};\r\n    auto offboard2 = Offboard{system[1]};\r\n    auto telemetry3 = Telemetry{system[2]};telemetry3::Position position3;\r\n    auto action3 = Action{system[2]};\r\n    auto offboard3 = Offboard{system[2]};\r\n****\r\n\r\nbut i am getting an error\r\n****\r\nerror: \u2018telemetry1\u2019 is not a class, namespace, or enumeration\r\n  195 |     auto telemetry1 = Telemetry{system[1]};telemetry1::Position position1;\r\n      |                                            ^~~~~~~~~~\r\n\r\nerror: \u2018telemetry2\u2019 is not a class, namespace, or enumeration\r\n  197 |     auto telemetry2 = Telemetry{system[1]};telemetry2::Position position2;\r\n      |                                            ^~~~~~~~~~\r\n error: \u2018telemetry3\u2019 is not a class, namespace, or enumeration\r\n  200 |     auto telemetry3 = Telemetry{system[2]};telemetry3::Position position3;\r\n\r\n***\r\nif u could plz help me out to get position of the drones.", "closed_by": {"login": "bazfp", "id": 1307881, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDc4ODE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1307881?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp", "html_url": "https://github.com/bazfp", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "