/api.github.com/users/saadnec/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saadnec/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saadnec/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-08-09T11:20:11Z", "updated_at": "2021-08-09T11:20:11Z", "body": "So if u could please guide me about how we are receiving callbacks. \r\n\r\n****\r\ntelemetry.subscribe_position([](Telemetry::Position position) {\r\n        std::cout << \"Altitude: \" << position.relative_altitude_m << \" m\\n\";\r\n    });\r\n****\r\nHere why are we passing Telemetry::Position not telemetry::Position  because we have initiated the system plugin by \"\"auto telemetry = Telemetry{system};\"\"", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/895143410/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/895148567", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1504#issuecomment-895148567", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1504", "id": 895148567, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s41WuIX", "user": {"login": "bazfp", "id": 1307881, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDc4ODE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1307881?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp", "html_url": "https://github.com/bazfp", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bazfp/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-08-09T11:30:02Z", "updated_at": "2021-08-09T11:32:07Z", "body": "> So if u could please guide me about how we are receiving callbacks.\r\n> \r\n> telemetry.subscribe_position([](Telemetry::Position position) {\r\n> std::cout << \"Altitude: \" << position.relative_altitude_m << \" m\\n\";\r\n> });\r\n> \r\n> Here why are we passing Telemetry::Position not telemetry::Position because we have initiated the system plugin by \"\"auto telemetry = Telemetry{system};\"\"\r\n\r\nThis is a C++ question - these bug reports are for MAVSDK library issues.\r\n\r\n`Telemetry::Position` is a data type. The instances you have created (`telemetry1` `telemetry2`) affect only how you setup the subscription.\r\n\r\n```\r\n// Setup for telemetry 1\r\ntelemetry1.subscribe_position([](Telemetry::Position position) {\r\nstd::cout << \"Altitude 1: \" << position.relative_altitude_m << \" \\n\";\r\n});`\r\n\r\n// Setup for telemetry 2\r\ntelemetry2.subscribe_position([](Telemetry::Position position) {\r\nstd::cout << \"Altitude 2: \" << position.relative_altitude_m << \" \\n\";\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe only difference is the variable you call `subscribe_position` onto :)\r\n\r\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/7627098/what-is-a-lambda-expression-in-c11\r\n\r\n", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/895148567/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/896560662", "html_url": "https